    <title>Vol.2 格鲁吉亚：离天堂最近的地方，宝藏免签国，世界葡萄酒的起源地</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674f51e217cd5416ad3bf6f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674f51e217cd5416ad3bf6f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">2:08</a> 为什么去格鲁吉亚？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiaJB4nDwScxxYH-GuKHj02c4UR_.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">3:32</a> 推荐出发季节</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fns9qeb-C-G9NkyXOfPsNBa9h7t4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="276">4:36</a> 格鲁吉亚的民族情绪与游行示威</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8JPTfGG_L1U1vituB4XqInaxG7.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="378">6:18</a> 格鲁吉亚代表美食：Khachapuri卡恰普里</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpEJx3a3kpck53XW25rWlQGen5qn.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqhXmejY6r5JA4_oVHY1f43cr9iz.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">7:57</a> 第比利斯玩法：钻石峡谷的高空极限运动、第比利斯博物馆、老城缆车看日落</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3jr8y7PTnTya8Pa9FZj7X_OFNR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FghL1AHm1umTOPQyQ-ZoAGROiX5T.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a>卡兹别克：离天堂最近的圣三一教堂、俄格纪念碑与雪山</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luXs7ctWaa9y_5oygP4myHRFq6Ua.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm-j7PZ5PDSpdsMa9qeO-_zERxO9.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgEONV8JOE-4HxdMHee4zq7U36dm.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJ1RM-wUus2DNLrefhER8vPW-_T.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="979">16:19</a> 梅斯蒂亚：徒步走在欧洲海拔最高的古老村落——乌树故里</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl20tneCiLHYvT0bBjz50s8Nxtu9.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtZaEVYo9b0D7PV6Rv6E-hlpp4GC.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh-DGqJUCKaBrwnSqsrE9juq2NnN.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgMWdK1G9aeIH5JAD3V5XHgqX30j.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuYREm6ckAdsw0t4CkG17nCEkGDb.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 西格纳吉：世界上葡萄酒的起源地、斯大林宴请毛泽东一起喝的酒Khvanchkara卡万奇卡拉、爬古长城</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqL0mhUZw2vYAyVqnz-xI3ufSAYa.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtDIeGeA0wVDURE28K4jmH0ZPI3x.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>感谢我的好朋友Echo愿意和我一起完成这个项目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿我们都能在行走世界时，享受人生的每一秒。</span></p>]]></description>
